---
import Education from "./Education.astro";
---

<section
    id="about"
    class="w-full px-5 py-5 md:flex md:justify-center md:flex-col"
>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold md:text-5xl">
            <span
                class="bg-linear-to-r from-azureblue to-steelblue bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >
                <span data-i18n="about.title">About</span>
            </span>
        </h3>
    </div>
    <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 mt-2 md:mx-auto md:w-full md:max-w-6xl">
        <p>
            <span data-i18n="about.paragraph1">I’m a software developer focused on building web applications and user-centered digital experiences. I enjoy turning ideas into functional interfaces, writing maintainable code, and improving the way users interact with software.</span>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span data-i18n="about.paragraph2">Over the last few years, I’ve worked on internal systems, business modules, and web solutions using technologies such as .NET, JavaScript, SQL Server, PHP, and modern frontend tools. I’m particularly interested in frontend development, clean UI design, and creating software that is both useful and intuitive.</span>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span data-i18n="about.paragraph3">Beyond coding, I’m constantly learning, exploring new technologies, and improving my skills through personal projects and self-driven study.</span>
        </p>
    </article>
    <Education />
</section>
